WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.211 --> 00:00:01.830
- However you wanna say, I'll accept.

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:02.932
- We're friends now,

00:00:02.932 --> 00:00:05.424
but we're gonna be enemies
after this challenge.

00:00:06.671 --> 00:00:07.936
Guys I'm here with Meghan Tonjes!

00:00:07.936 --> 00:00:08.609
- Hi!

00:00:08.609 --> 00:00:11.256
- We're doing the No Thumbs Challenge,

00:00:11.256 --> 00:00:13.078
which was originally
created by Rachel Ballinger

00:00:13.078 --> 00:00:13.914
here on YouTube.

00:00:13.914 --> 00:00:16.654
I've tweeted out asking you
guys for everyday activities

00:00:16.654 --> 00:00:20.797
that would be more difficult
to do if we didn't have thumbs.

00:00:20.797 --> 00:00:21.725
- Correct.

00:00:21.725 --> 00:00:24.362
- So Jack Ferry's gonna
read out a series of tweets.

00:00:24.362 --> 00:00:27.321
We're gonna race to try
to get that challenge done

00:00:27.321 --> 00:00:28.738
without our thumbs,

00:00:28.738 --> 00:00:32.476
and the first person to get
to five will be the winner!

00:00:32.476 --> 00:00:33.695
Meghan was saying before that

00:00:33.695 --> 00:00:35.785
she plays guitar so she thinks she has

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:37.980
the strength and dexterity in her fingers

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:39.302
that's really gonna help her out,

00:00:39.302 --> 00:00:40.799
and I don't.

00:00:40.799 --> 00:00:41.438
- I'm hoping.

00:00:41.438 --> 00:00:42.760
- I have long ET-like fingers

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:45.110
so maybe that will be
something advantageous.

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:47.103
- Or it'll be to your detriment,
'cause I got little fingers

00:00:47.103 --> 00:00:48.561
so maybe I'll be able to like.

00:00:48.561 --> 00:00:49.051
- Yeah.

00:00:49.051 --> 00:00:50.361
- Hold it down easier.

00:00:50.361 --> 00:00:51.128
(both laugh)

00:00:51.128 --> 00:00:52.959
I'm doing this motion, and
I know it's gonna get GIFed

00:00:52.959 --> 00:00:54.444
and it's gonna post to Tumblr.

00:00:54.444 --> 00:00:58.102
- Jack Ferry, tape master extraordinaire,

00:00:58.102 --> 00:00:59.505
- Everybody's favorite Jack.

00:00:59.505 --> 00:01:01.165
This is the weirdest thing
a dude's ever done to me,

00:01:01.165 --> 00:01:02.222
I will say that.

00:01:02.222 --> 00:01:03.383
(Grace laughs)

00:01:03.383 --> 00:01:05.159
- How many times Jack Ferry has now

00:01:05.159 --> 00:01:07.667
since taped up my hands
here on Not Too Deep?

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:07.987
- Yeah.

00:01:07.987 --> 00:01:09.507
- I think it's...

00:01:09.507 --> 00:01:11.004
(tape ripping)

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:11.548
- It's like.

00:01:11.548 --> 00:01:12.326
- Too many.

00:01:12.326 --> 00:01:15.101
- Like it's way too many
than like friends should have

00:01:15.101 --> 00:01:16.976
as a number between themselves.

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:18.275
- Can you move your thumbs?

00:01:18.275 --> 00:01:18.996
- No.

00:01:18.996 --> 00:01:21.329
- I can, but tape it more, tape me down.

00:01:21.329 --> 00:01:22.347
(laughing)

00:01:22.347 --> 00:01:24.192
- There we go, that one's in good.

00:01:24.192 --> 00:01:25.654
- Turn into a crustacean.

00:01:25.654 --> 00:01:26.304
- Grace are you--

00:01:26.304 --> 00:01:27.367
- I'm great.

00:01:29.636 --> 00:01:32.260
Okay, so Jack, first challenge.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.119
- [Jack] Open a bottle.

00:01:33.629 --> 00:01:34.384
- Open a bottle.

00:01:36.314 --> 00:01:37.254
Oh no, oh no!

00:01:37.256 --> 00:01:39.027
Oh no, fingers go!

00:01:39.078 --> 00:01:40.107
- Wait, wait.

00:01:40.611 --> 00:01:41.104
- No.

00:01:41.104 --> 00:01:41.829
- Yeah!

00:01:41.829 --> 00:01:43.204
- How?

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:45.872
- Do you want some help?

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.213
Ah yeah, feels good right?

00:01:47.213 --> 00:01:49.843
- Yeah, that's a weirdly cathartic bet.

00:01:50.753 --> 00:01:52.037
- [Jack] Peel a banana.

00:01:52.472 --> 00:01:54.220
- Okay, easy, done.

00:01:57.929 --> 00:01:58.512
How do you--

00:01:58.512 --> 00:01:59.771
- I'm getting there, I'm getting there.

00:02:00.178 --> 00:02:01.065
- Wait.

00:02:01.065 --> 00:02:02.239
- [Jack] Oh Meghan.

00:02:02.239 --> 00:02:03.422
- Meghan!

00:02:03.422 --> 00:02:04.863
- This is getting GIFed too!

00:02:04.863 --> 00:02:06.610
(all laughing)

00:02:07.567 --> 00:02:09.975
- New challenge, can Meghan
make this not sexual?

00:02:11.119 --> 00:02:13.405
As she slowly eat a banana with no thumbs,

00:02:13.405 --> 00:02:15.287
which is a very weird visual.

00:02:15.287 --> 00:02:16.286
(laughing)

00:02:16.286 --> 00:02:17.788
Okay, two to zero, here we go.

00:02:17.788 --> 00:02:18.895
Next challenge.

00:02:18.895 --> 00:02:21.140
- [Jack] Open a bag of chips and eat one.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:22.261
- Done.

00:02:25.018 --> 00:02:25.877
- Aw dammit.

00:02:25.877 --> 00:02:27.038
(Jack laughs)

00:02:27.038 --> 00:02:28.594
- It's all about wanting it.

00:02:28.594 --> 00:02:29.690
(all laughing)

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:31.094
- [Meghan] I'm like covered in banana

00:02:31.094 --> 00:02:32.865
and Cheeto and water.

00:02:33.416 --> 00:02:34.635
- Uh oh, this is intense build-up,

00:02:34.635 --> 00:02:35.987
are we on American Idol?

00:02:36.249 --> 00:02:36.684
- [Jack] Alright, you ready?

00:02:36.684 --> 00:02:37.183
- Yeah.

00:02:37.183 --> 00:02:39.534
- [Jack] Okay, write your
first name on a piece of paper.

00:02:40.004 --> 00:02:41.055
- Okay.

00:02:43.809 --> 00:02:44.281
No!

00:02:44.281 --> 00:02:45.179
- Yeah!

00:02:45.179 --> 00:02:46.971
- And your name is longer than mine!

00:02:46.971 --> 00:02:48.586
Yeah that was actually pretty easy.

00:02:48.586 --> 00:02:49.490
That one wasn't that difficult.

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:50.152
That looks great.

00:02:50.152 --> 00:02:50.837
- Thank you.

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:52.195
- So three to one!

00:02:52.195 --> 00:02:53.878
- [Jack] Cut through that piece of paper

00:02:53.878 --> 00:02:55.132
with a pair of scissors.

00:02:55.132 --> 00:02:56.478
- Oh I thought with the knife.

00:02:56.478 --> 00:02:58.835
Oh with, cut through? How much through?

00:02:58.835 --> 00:02:59.915
- All of it, all of it!

00:02:59.915 --> 00:03:00.809
- [Jack] All the way.

00:03:00.809 --> 00:03:04.139
(both shouting)

00:03:04.139 --> 00:03:05.642
- [Jack] Oh, Meghan!

00:03:05.642 --> 00:03:07.215
(Jack laughing)

00:03:09.106 --> 00:03:10.522
- Thank you, thank you.

00:03:10.522 --> 00:03:12.020
Show off how quickly you can get it done

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:13.239
and then help me out.

00:03:13.239 --> 00:03:13.951
- Yeah, you're welcome.

00:03:13.951 --> 00:03:15.750
- Ah, okay what is it, four to one?

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.074
Shit, okay.

00:03:17.074 --> 00:03:18.698
Let's do this.

00:03:18.698 --> 00:03:20.754
- [Jack] Make a peanut
butter and jelly sandwich.

00:03:20.754 --> 00:03:21.973
- Done, done.

00:03:21.973 --> 00:03:23.331
Okay, oh god.

00:03:23.331 --> 00:03:25.630
(Jack laughing)

00:03:27.062 --> 00:03:28.201
Oh yeah!

00:03:28.201 --> 00:03:28.955
- Oh no.

00:03:28.955 --> 00:03:29.954
- Does it have--

00:03:29.954 --> 00:03:31.799
- How did you get that, oh
there we go, there we go.

00:03:31.799 --> 00:03:33.181
- Does this have a cap?

00:03:33.181 --> 00:03:36.205
(both talking indistinctly)

00:03:38.399 --> 00:03:39.118
Done!

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:39.780
- No!

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:40.646
- [Jack] Ah, that's Grace.

00:03:40.646 --> 00:03:41.804
- Mine's taste better though.

00:03:41.804 --> 00:03:42.622
(Jack laughing)

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:43.899
'Cause mine's got love in it.

00:03:43.899 --> 00:03:45.837
- I cut mine diagonally, legit.

00:03:45.837 --> 00:03:47.990
Would two of you like this sandwich?

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.517
(Jack laughing)

00:03:49.875 --> 00:03:51.036
- Yeah, that's great.

00:03:51.036 --> 00:03:54.710
- Meghan Tonjes makes the
most unsexual challenge.

00:03:56.201 --> 00:03:57.293
- [Jack] Floss.

00:03:57.293 --> 00:03:59.638
- I mean, this is up for interpretation.

00:03:59.638 --> 00:04:01.159
(Jack laughing)

00:04:01.159 --> 00:04:02.413
- Knuckles are getting in the way.

00:04:02.413 --> 00:04:05.500
- Oh my god, I don't even
know how to floss with thumbs.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:06.894
- Ah yeah!

00:04:06.894 --> 00:04:08.476
- Oh!

00:04:09.096 --> 00:04:11.320
My dentist would be so proud of you.

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:12.922
(all laughing)

00:04:12.922 --> 00:04:15.058
So not only was this a challenge video,

00:04:15.058 --> 00:04:17.565
it's also a message about dental hygiene.

00:04:17.565 --> 00:04:20.467
No more excuses, 'cause you
can do without your thumbs.

00:04:20.467 --> 00:04:21.977
- This is still a thing
that exists though,

00:04:21.977 --> 00:04:22.685
what is this?

00:04:22.685 --> 00:04:24.287
- That's your takeaway.

00:04:24.287 --> 00:04:27.305
Well Meghan Tonjes, thank
you so much for being here.

00:04:27.305 --> 00:04:28.025
- Thank you.

00:04:28.025 --> 00:04:29.406
- I hope that you enjoyed this challenge.

00:04:29.406 --> 00:04:31.763
We're about to film, or record rather,

00:04:31.763 --> 00:04:33.051
a full episode of Not Too Deep,

00:04:33.051 --> 00:04:34.607
so make sure you go over
to SoundCloud or iTunes

00:04:34.607 --> 00:04:35.988
and listen to that full episode,

00:04:35.988 --> 00:04:37.741
and where can they find
you across the Internet?

00:04:37.741 --> 00:04:39.564
- Meghan Tonjes on everything.

00:04:39.564 --> 00:04:41.224
youtube.com/tonjes

00:04:41.224 --> 00:04:42.582
- Tonjes!

00:04:42.582 --> 00:04:44.161
I don't know.

00:04:44.161 --> 00:04:45.868
- Got in a fight where
they were both yelling

00:04:45.868 --> 00:04:46.836
about having guns.

00:04:46.836 --> 00:04:47.589
(both laughing)

00:04:47.589 --> 00:04:48.587
- Oh my god!

00:04:48.587 --> 00:04:51.188
- He was like, "I have a (beep) gat."

00:04:51.188 --> 00:04:52.743
And she was like, "I have a (beep) gat."

00:04:52.743 --> 00:04:54.841
And I was like, "I'm gonna go inside."

